{"text": "PHILIP MORRIS\n\nCOMPANIES INC.\n120 PARK AVENUE, NEW YORK, NY. 10017 \u00bb TELEPHONE (017) 660000\n\nJune 3, 1999\nPRIVILEGED AND CONFIDENTIAL\nTo: \u2018The Board of Directors of Philip Morris Companies Inc.\nFROM: \u2014 Murray H. Bring \u201cWe?\nRE: LITIGATION VICTORY\n\nLate yesterday afternoon, the jury in the Butler ETS case returned a defense\nverdict after less than two hours deliberation. This is the second ETS case that we have\n\n\u2018won, and this victory should discourage the filing of similar suits,\n\nThis is also the third jury verdict in our favor since the two losses in San\nFrancisco and Portland, and they should go a long way in demonstrating the strength of\nour defenses in individual smoker cases and our ability to manage these cases\nsuccessfully.\n\u2018The trial in Phase 1 of the Engle case has been completed, but the sudden illness\nof the judge last week has delayed the closing arguments and submission to the jury.\n\u2018Those arguments are now scheduled to commence on June 14, but a further delay is\n\npossible, depending upon the judge's health.\n\n\u00a3990b9\u00a2202", "words": [{"text": "PHILIP", "x0": 255, "y0": 143, "x1": 356, "y1": 192, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "MORRIS", "x0": 366, "y0": 145, "x1": 486, "y1": 193, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "COMPANIES", "x0": 330, "y0": 203, "x1": 388, "y1": 210, "conf": 58.0}, {"text": "INC.", "x0": 392, "y0": 204, "x1": 411, "y1": 210, "conf": 85.0}, {"text": "120", "x0": 223, "y0": 221, "x1": 236, "y1": 227, "conf": 38.0}, {"text": "PARK", "x0": 240, "y0": 209, "x1": 261, "y1": 237, "conf": 83.0}, {"text": "AVENUE,", "x0": 265, "y0": 209, "x1": 301, "y1": 237, "conf": 83.0}, {"text": "NEW", "x0": 305, "y0": 209, "x1": 322, "y1": 237, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "YORK,", "x0": 326, "y0": 209, "x1": 350, "y1": 237, "conf": 74.0}, {"text": "NY.", "x0": 356, "y0": 209, "x1": 371, "y1": 237, "conf": 68.0}, {"text": "10017", "x0": 373, "y0": 221, "x1": 396, "y1": 227, "conf": 68.0}, {"text": "\